WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:36.990
Your Graduation

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.320
Public Performance

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:37.200
Tsumugino High School Drama Club

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.210
The Drama Club's putting on a play here, right?

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.500
Amamiya Sayuri's in the play this year!

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.210
Let's go check it out!

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:50.970
Are you ready? This is the real thing!

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.280
Are you nervous?

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.980
Kurotokage-sensei?

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.500
Sign says: School Choir Gospel.

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:07.690
You'll be fine. I guarantee it.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.340
Thank you very much.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.990
Well then, give it your all.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:23.990
An Exciting Culture Festival

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:27.820
Tsumugino High School Culture Festival

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.820
It's going to be a wonderful festival this year as well.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:37.000
Note: The signs along the wall are for concession stand items.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:35.560
Yes, indeed.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:37.040
It's a big day for everyone.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.730
What else...

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:44.530
What else is left for me?

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:47.610
I guess it happens this time every year.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.970
I want to devote what little is left of my life to
introducing students to the world of literature.

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:54.530
I... see.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:58.290
He looks perfectly healthy. Geez.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:04.280
Science Club Exhibition

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:04.280
Meido Cafe

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.850
Hey. That's a maid cafe.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.750
Let's check it out!

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:14.080
Meido

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:14.400
Welcome, fellow scientists, to the Meido Cafe!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:17.100
TL note: "Meido" is pronounced the same as maid; however, "meido" means "the underworld."

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:17.100
Meido?! It's not a maid cafe?!

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.610
Now, drink up!

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:30.110
Drink the special potion prepared by the Grand Sage of the Science Club's Meido Cafe!

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.670
M-Meido Grand Sage?! What the hell?!

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:33.620
Nooooo!!!

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.540
You will surely return to your true forms.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.790
You will meet the spirits of the dead.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.380
"Welcome home," I guess.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:46.870
Meido

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:50.570
SOMEONE SAVE US!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:56.640
Why isn't anyone coming?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.230
Sign says: Sports Club Event Area.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:00.230
Yeah. It's not exciting.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:02.320
That's the reason.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.200
Look over there at the school grounds.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:05.400
Hmm?

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:11.610
What the hell?!

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.450
It'll be popular.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.770
They've got real ghosts in there.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.620
What?

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:23.620
Exit

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.740
That was awesome! I was so scared!

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.910
Yeah. That was ultra-scary!

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:29.080
Package says: Magic Shortbread.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:26.260
Hey! Get souvenirs of your terrifying ordeal right here!

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:29.080
Who'd like some bread prepared by famous ghosts?

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.450
I'll take one of those!

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.620
I'll have some magic bread too!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.040
Sure! Thanks for buying!

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:38.640
I'm gonna rake it in!

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.550
Entrance

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.930
There will be a one-hour wait from the end of the line.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.450
You're together, right?

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:44.390
Please come inside.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.690
Hey, I've run out of change!

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.000
What the hell is this?

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.190
We're getting too many customers!

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:54.060
Oh, my! There are so many people here, Watatake-sensei.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.710
Yes, it's all thanks to you.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.890
I'm impressed that you managed to make something like this.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:06.340
As the vice-principal, I-

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:08.290
Aoba-kun. You've done a wonderful job.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:09.940
Please keep up the good work.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.580
Thank you very much.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.880
That's great, Aoba-kun.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.970
Yeah. It's all because you worked so hard.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:20.870
Oh... Thanks.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:25.480
They praised him, but he's not happy. I wonder why.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:29.190
Yeah. He did so much work, but he's always like this.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.400
No kidding. Ignorance sure is bliss.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.640
Well, it's almost time.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:35.370
Oh!

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:36.740
Amamiya's play!

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:40.740
Yeah! Even if I have an afro, I've got to see her play!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.110
Oh! I'm coming too!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.130
Aoba! We don't have enough people on security!

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.660
There are too many customers!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:49.960
What? But I've got to see Amamiya's play!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.020
You've got work to do!

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:52.900
That's right!

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.510
Work comes first!

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:55.740
But that's...

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:04.900
The Tsumugino High School Drama Club will now be performing "Your Graduation."

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.730
Thank you so much for coming.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.950
Please relax and enjoy our play.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:20.200
It happened three years ago.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.800
I met him three years ago.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.510
We don't have enough chairs.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:41.410
Do something about it!

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:41.960
The signs are for games, food, and events.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:41.960
I'm so sorry!

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.310
I'll go get some!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:49.390
Hey. Which floor is the Archery Club exhibition on?

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:50.270
Let me see...

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.020
I'm sure it was...

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:52.960
The third floor.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.000
Ah, okay. Thank you.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.450
Listen, are you really going to leave?

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:01.450
I'm sorry.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.000
Will you leave me behind?

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.260
It's for your own good.

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:09.500
How... How could this happen?

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:10.760
It's amazing!

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.440
It's just like real life!

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.710
Keep it up, Amamiya-san.

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.580
That was great, Amamiya-san!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.600
I'm sure the rest of the play will be that good!

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:37.190
Isn't Aoba-kun coming to see me?

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.330
I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused you.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.350
Thanks, Onii-chan!

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:28.260
Phew...

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.080
Now I'm all alone again.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:31.250
Huh?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.280
I can still make it in time.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:53.550
I will always be here, under this tree!

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:09.310
WOW!

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:23.570
That was the conclusion of the Drama Club's play, "Your Graduation."

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:20.200
Bravo! Bravo!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.660
Thank you so much for coming to see us.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.090
The play!... Woah!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.330
Yo! Metal Ryuk here!

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.770
We're gonna have a blast today!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.590
YEAHHHHHHHH!

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:42.270
We've got one more special guest.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:45.060
The singing idol, Nishida Natsumi-chan!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.610
Good afternoon, everyone from Tsumugino High School!

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.620
Nishida Natsumi here!

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.990
I hope you're enjoying the Culture Festival!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.670
Haven't I seen you somewhere before, Natsumi-chan?

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:07.420
Yep. There was a huge haunted house, so I went to check it out.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:09.680
I disguised myself with these.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:17.770
Oh, but a haunted house at a Culture Festival couldn't be that scary, could it?

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:19.190
Isn't that right, everyone?

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.410
Well, that's...

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.940
Let's change the subject, Metal-san.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.440
Was it that scary?

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:36.870
I was there with my manager, but Nat-chan had to go on stage, so he told me to come here ahead of him.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:38.460
I see.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:47.190
So... Natsumi... Natsumi will work hard for her manager!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:50.970
YEAH!

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.390
Tokimeki!

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:53.460
Memorial!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.440
Only Love!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.160
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:00.970
I'm Shinjou Sakura.

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:08.620
Um... Hiyoko-kun.

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.870
I am not Hiyoko.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:19.560
Here I go!

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.940
Stop it, Matsutaka-kun!

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:23.940
Please don't try this at home.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:20.360
hora?????

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.040
Matsuei-kun, you're scary.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.570
soreeeee????

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.820
Stop it already you two!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.870
I guess now's not the best time.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.450
What's wrong?

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:36.610
You don't look well.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:38.760
Kasuga-san.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.230
Did something happen?

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:41.830
Actually...

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:45.270
I wasn't able to see Amamiya-san's play.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:46.370
Oh...

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.280
Say, Riku-kun.

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:53.490
Huh?

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:56.990
Uh... Are you free now?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:12:00.990
Drama Club Room

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:00.600
All right then. Let's give it our all and celebrate the success of the Drama Club.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.160
Ready, set...

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.040
Cheers!

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:08.190
Board says: Celebrate the Success of "Your Graduation."

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:08.190
How did it go, Kurotokage-sensei?

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:10.840
Well, I suppose you could say that we passed.

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:13.200
yeah~

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:17.430
Some special guests helped us out this time, but let's try not to rely on them next time.

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.340
Okay!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.310
Why did I say that?

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:25.650
But what? Why don't you just say what you mean?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.400
I knew it. I've got to apologize to him.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.070
Amamiya-san? Where are you going?

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:39.120
Curse them! Where did they go?!

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.250
Doesn't Amamiya-san have her play?

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:43.470
That should have finished ages ago.

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:45.860
I'm sure they're fooling around somewhere.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:48.920
Those guys...

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:52.010
They're ignoring us. They only wanted us to wear these uniforms.

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:53.840
I won't let them get away with this!

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:55.800
Oh! It's Sayuri!

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.590
What's the rush?

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.610
H-Hey. Have you seen Aoba-kun?

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.120
Aoba-kun?

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:07.610
Now that you mention it, some students from the committee dragged him off somewhere.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.110
I see.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:11.530
Hey, never mind that.

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:13.070
Will you help us?

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.900
We're short-handed here.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:15.820
Um...

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:17.310
Well...

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:17.870
Sorry!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:20.340
Geez.

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:22.160
I wish I could fool around.

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.410
I guess those are her true colors.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.510
What's wrong with Amamiya-san?

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:28.920
I wonder...

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.410
Wow! That was awesome!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.590
The Mystery Club's exhibit was really interesting.

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:39.700
Yeah...

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:43.270
Hey, where should we go next?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:44.860
What about the Science Club's stall?

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:46.590
It looks dangerous, so let's give it a miss.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.490
What about the Arts Club?

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.810
What about Harinui-sensei's stall?

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:58.240
W-Well, how about visiting the stalls one by one?

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.210
I'm starving! Let's go grab a bite!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.410
Well?

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:02.790
B-But, I...

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.610
Come on!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.050
Wow! It's so lively here!

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:08.920
Yeah...

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:11.930
There are so many different stalls here. I never expected this.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:14.130
I guess so.

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:18.290
Geez!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.400
You've been gloomy for quite a while now.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.260
Mo-chan...

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.970
You're worried about Aoba-san again, aren't you?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:27.060
No, th-that's not it!

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:29.000
I knew it.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:32.280
You wanted to spend the day with him, didn't you?

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.900
You could try calling him.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.240
But he seems busy with his tasks for the committee.

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:39.410
They're working him to death.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.710
Why don't you go see him in person?

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.290
I'd like to see the haunted house anyway.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.330
But that place is...

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.170
It's so realistic, right?

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:51.080
Let's check it out while we look for him!

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:52.790
N-No way!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.180
It's not safe!

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.750
Come on, come on!

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:59.000
Note: Stalls are for food, games, and events.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:00.400
And the best thing is, Inukai-senpai is supervising it. Lucky me!

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:06.960
Geez! Don't stop so suddenly!

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.150
A-Aoba-san.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.960
That takoyaki was great!

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:13.830
Y-Yeah...

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.050
Hey, why don't we check out the archery range?

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:20.110
That settles it!

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:21.450
You're in big trouble!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:24.040
She's wrapped Aoba-kun around her finger!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.950
Mi-chan! Now's the time to take a stand!

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:28.580
Go! Fight, Mi-chan!

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:39.190
Excuse me!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.680
Oh! Mina-chan!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.660
May I join you?

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:47.460
Yeah. I don't mind.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:51.190
I'm <i>not</i>  gonna lose!

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.910
Okay! I'm in!

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:00.810
Take that!

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.490
She got me!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.690
All right!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.120
Sign says: Rescue the Baby Trout.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.120
No one's coming.

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:27.510
I wonder who's going to come and rescue you.

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:29.250
Senpai!

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:31.380
Let me have a go!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.140
Me too!

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.160
Here we go, Mina-chan!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.150
Right!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:50.170
??

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.720
This wasn't what I had in mind.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:00.000
Hey! Tidy this up now!

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.020
Aoba-kun's not here either.

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:07.280
Those two took all my adorable baby trouties!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.230
The Culture Festival's almost over.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.990
Aoba-kun. Where are you?

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:36.500
That concludes Tsumugino High School's Culture Festival for this year.

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:41.750
Could all students please start tidying everything up as soon as possible?

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.600
Aoba-kun...

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:54.520
What? You expect us to believe that Sayuri's play finished in the evening?!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.160
Y-Yes.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.720
We just happened to lose track of the time.

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:01.320
So we didn't abandon you on purpose.

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:03.070
Please forgive us!

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.260
Why should we?

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:07.860
We couldn't have any fun because of you!

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:09.730
Well, that's the way it is.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.080
We'll let the ghosts take care of your punishment.

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:14.470
Oh no!

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:17.070
Will we get afros again? Will we?

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.040
Sign says: Ultra Haunted House.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.040
Ask them to be gentle, at least!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.620
Inukai-kun...

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:25.590
Oh, it's you.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.430
Thanks for everything.

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:28.550
You were a big help.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.100
I see.

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:41.710
Hey! Inukai-kun!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:42.620
What are you doing?

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.950
If you need to use it again, I'll just paint it again.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.870
Hey, Aoba-kun!

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:54.160
Oh, Shiina-san!

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:56.250
Sorry about this.

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.380
It looks like I made you do all the work.

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:01.180
What are you saying? Don't worry about it.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.170
I heard that you were showing Tsukasa and Mina around.

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.420
How did you know?

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:07.710
Look at this.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.430
They brought these as a souvenir for you.

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:13.980
They also wanted to apologize to you.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.730
They said they're sorry.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:16.770
I see.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.510
By the way, have you seen Sayuri?

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.940
No, I haven't. Why?

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.750
She's been looking for you.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.440
But she hasn't come back yet.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.460
Well then! Shall we have some grilled fish?

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:55.420
Amamiya-san...

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:32.990
Aoba-kun...

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:40.580
Why do I feel this way?

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.720
Amamiya-san!

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:57.830
Thank goodness.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.090
I finally found you.

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:01.630
Um...

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.700
I-I'm sorry!

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:07.500
Huh?

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.770
Geez! What's your problem, Aoba-kun?

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:21.260
Well, I couldn't see your play today.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:22.680
And that's why I...

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:24.060
I'm sorry.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:25.790
I see.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:28.570
I wanted you to come and see me.

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:30.350
I wanted to come and see you too!

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:33.250
But I had a lot of work to do, and in the end...

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:36.510
I guess it couldn't be helped.

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:39.880
You worked hard and did my share of the work.

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:41.620
Oh no, it wasn't hard at all.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:46.880
Thank you, Aoba-kun.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:49.760
You're welcome.

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:03.020
Oh, man. I really wanted to see you.

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:03.890
Really?

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:06.390
Hey, will you show me some of your acting? Just a little?

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:08.020
What? Right here?

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:09.550
Yeah! In our special park!

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:10.660
Geez.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:12.600
All right, but just a little.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:14.290
Hooray!

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:27.900
My heart is overflowing!

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:43.440
Even if I try to conceal my feelings for you,

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:48.980
I can't help blushing when our eyes meet.

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:57.890
I kept this a secret from my friends,

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:04.530
Because I didn't want to be teased.

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:13.780
The important thing that nobody knows,

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:21.240
I'll only tell to you.

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.370
These gently falling flower petals

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:29.030
are sneaking into my heart.

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:35.910
I want to make your heart flutter.

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:39.960
It's okay to have hopes

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:43.630
for the future we await, right?

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:49.940
My heart is overflowing!

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:52.450
Next Episode Preview

00:23:49.940 --> 00:24:19.970
Tokimeki      Memorial

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:52.680
We met each other by chance.

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:53.770
I wonder why.

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:56.000
My heart was fluttering ever since I first laid eyes on you.

00:23:56.690 --> 00:23:57.650
This could be destiny!

00:23:58.260 --> 00:24:01.020
That's why I wanted to be with you, always.

00:24:01.610 --> 00:24:03.880
But my heart isn't fluttering any longer.

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:09.260
My heart aches when I see you with another girl.

00:24:09.730 --> 00:24:10.630
That's why I...

00:24:11.500 --> 00:24:13.930
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:15.540
An Exciting Field Trip.

00:24:15.730 --> 00:24:16.600
Please watch it!

00:24:17.050 --> 00:24:19.350
The most important thing to me is to get fired up and look forward!
